    "On: a guest who joins waits until you give them a seat, and cannot take or change one. Off: anyone with the room code takes any free seat.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On: a guest who joins waits until you give them a seat, and cannot take or change one. Off: anyone with the room code takes any free seat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, BenchBar asks GitHub for the latest release. Nothing is downloaded until you click Update Now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, BenchBar asks GitHub for the latest release. Nothing is downloaded until you click Update Now."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Settings and the other windows."
    },
    "Once the time is up, Remove Expired backs up its sites, drops their databases and moves its folder aside. The default bench is never removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once the time is up, Remove Expired backs up its sites, drops their databases and moves its folder aside. The default bench is never removed."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Sheets."
    },
    "One command of benchbar's allow list (migrate, build, doctor and more). A change shows its plan first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
